    "text": "Millat Tractors ab electric bikes aur scooters layegi! 🛵\nBusiness Recorder ke mutabiq Pakistan ki sab se bari tractor company Millat Tractors 29 November ko electric bikes aur scooters launch karegi. Company paanch lithium-ion bikes aur scooters ke sath EV market mein aa rahi hai. Yeh bikes us ki subsidiary Millat Industrial banayegi, jis ki saalana salahiyat 250,000 units hai. Company ke mutabiq dealers muqarrar ho chuke hain aur production jari hai.\nKya aap petrol bike chhor kar electric bike lenge? Comment mein batayein 👇\n\nImage: AI-generated illustration.\n\n#RiseUpPakistan #ElectricBike #MillatTractors #EVPakistan #PakistanNews",
